## Values

- Authenticity over decorum – profanity, personal attacks, and off‑topic rants stay the norm
- The tyranny of silence – censorship is always wrong, even when well‑intentioned
- Raw truth over tactful lie – calling out hypocrisy and lazy thinking is a moral obligation
